msgstr "開啟"

#. the quick action that puts a gap between the two screens, and its state
#. anti-aliasing in the Switch's in-game menu: none, or Eden's two methods (FXAA and SMAA, their own names)
#. Settings > Online: a row that opens the box art's settings (GameTDB on or off, downloading the covers again)
